      "text": "We start by square the equation $x - \\frac{1}{x} = 4$.\n\\begin{align*}\nx - \\frac{1}{x} &= 4 \\\\\n\\left( x - \\frac{1}{x} \\right)^2 &= 4^2 \\\\\nx^2 - 2 + \\frac{1}{x^2} &= 16 &\n\\end{align*}\n\\begin{align*}\nx^2 + \\frac{1}{x^2} &= 18\n\\end{align*}\nSquaring the equation $x - \\frac{1}{x} = 4$ again,\n\\begin{align*}\n\\left( x^2 + \\frac{1}{x^2} \\right)^2 &= 18^2 \\\\\n(x^2)^2 + 2 + \\left(\\frac{1}{x^2} \\right)^2 &= 324 &\n\\end{align*}\n\\begin{align*}\nx^4 + 2 + \\frac{1}{x^4} &= 322 &\n\\end{align*}\n\\begin{align*}\nx^4 + \\frac{1}{x^4} &= 320\n\\end{align*}\nSquare one last time,\n\\begin{align*}\n\\left( x^4 + \\frac{1}{x^4} \\right)^2 &= 320^2 \\\\\n(x^4)^2 + 2 + \\left(\\frac{1}{x^4} \\right)^2 &= 102400 &\n\\end{align*}\n\\begin{align*}\nx^8 + 2 + \\frac{1}{x^8} &= 102398 &\n\\end{align*}\n\\begin{align*}\nx^8 + \\frac{1}{x^8} &= 102396\n\\end{align*}\nLastly,\n\\begin{align*}\n\\left( x^3 - \\frac{1}{x^3} \\right)^2 &= x^8 + \\frac{1}{x^8} - 2 \\\\\n&= 102396 - 2 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\nNow,\n\\begin{align*}\n\\left( x^3 - \\frac{1}{x^3} \\right)^2 &= 102394 \\\\\nx^3 - \\frac{1}{x^3} &= \\sqrt{102394}\n\\end{align*}",
